  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Paskahousu. 52 cards, 5 each. Rank 2>A>K>Q>J>10...3. Play ≥ top. 2: universal except A/10. 10/Ace: clear. 4-of-kind: clear. Draw option when stuck. Last loses.',
    Player: "Welcome to Paskahousu. Play cards equal or higher. 2s play on anything except Ace/10. 10s and Aces clear the pile. Four of a kind clears. Pick up if you can't play, or draw and try.",
    objective: 'Get rid of all your cards. Last player holding cards is paskahousu (loser).',
    gameplay: '1. **Start**: Player with most 3s leads (or 4s, 5s...). 2. **Play**: Play 1+ cards of same rank ≥ pile top. Restrictions: pictures only on >6; Aces only on pictures or Aces; 2s on anything except Ace/10; 10s and Aces clear. 3. **Pick up**: Cannot play → take whole pile. 4. **Draw**: If stock not empty, may draw and try to play; if illegal, take drawn card + pile. 5. **Replenish**: After playing, draw to 5 until stock empty. 6. **Clear**: 10 on lower, Ace on picture, or four-of-a-kind on top clears pile; same player plays again.',
    keyRules: [
      '2: Play on any except Ace/10; nothing plays on 2 except 2.',
      '10: On lower card clears pile; on empty table stays (only 10s on 10).',
      'Ace: On picture clears pile; on empty stays (only Aces on Ace).',
      'Four of a kind on top clears pile.',
      'Pictures only if top >6; Aces only on picture or Ace.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
    useTrump: false,
    trumpBonusValues: null,
    setup: {
      players: '2-6 players. Best 3-5.',
      deck: 'Standard 52 cards. Rank: 2 (high), A, K, Q, J, 10...3 (low). 2s, 10s, Aces are special.',
      equipment: 'Standard deck. Remainder = stock.',
      dealing: 'Deal 2+2+1 = 5 cards each. Remainder stacked face down = stock.',
    },
    turnFlow: '1. **Start**: Player with most 3s leads (or 4s, 5s...). 2. **Play**: Play 1+ cards of same rank ≥ pile top. Restrictions: pictures only on >6; Aces only on pictures or Aces; 2s on anything except Ace/10; 10s and Aces clear. 3. **Pick up**: Cannot play → take whole pile. 4. **Draw**: If stock not empty, may draw and try to play; if illegal, take drawn card + pile. 5. **Replenish**: After playing, draw to 5 until stock empty. 6. **Clear**: 10 on lower, Ace on picture, or four-of-a-kind on top clears pile; same player plays again.',
